   "kind": "note",
   "props": {
    "flag": "mira_p1",
    "text": "17 October. 02:43. Loop one? I don't know what to call it.\n\nThe lights went, and then it was 02:43 again, and Evelyn was saying 'Take him, Mira' again — except I had already taken him. My arms still feel the weight of him.\n\nI'm writing this down because the notebook is the only thing that stays where I leave it.",
    "title": "Mira's notebook — page 1 of 5"
   },
