  {
   "symbol": "f",
   "kind": "note",
   "props": {
    "flag": "c3_file",
    "text": "PATIENT: VOSS, DANIEL (dependent of Dr. E. Voss)\nDOB: 14-08-1997\nAGE AT ASSESSMENT: 14 months\n\nAUDIOMETRY: Normal range. Unremarkable.\n\nADDITIONAL: Subject reacts to the 107.9 MHz carrier with NO receiver present. Stops crying, turns head toward the array, tracks it. Auditory evoked response off our scale. Repeated x6. Repeated with the carrier switched off: no response.\n\nHe is hearing the carrier. Not through the speaker. Directly.\n\nRecommend D. is removed from site. Director declined.\n— S. Lind, MD",
    "title": "Patient file — VOSS, D."
   },
   "sequence": 15,
   "lines": -1
  },
