    "text": "MORGUE — REGISTER\n\nDrawer 1 — empty\nDrawer 2 — empty\nDrawer 3 — empty\nDrawer 4 — OCCUPIED (17 Oct, 02:47)\n             Name: ________\n             Nobody can remember who.\n             Nobody can remember bringing him down.\n             Drawer will not open.\nDrawer 5 — empty",
    "title": "Morgue register"
   },
   "sequence": -1,
