  {
   "steps": [
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "BRANDT (TAPE)",
      "Sergeant Paul Brandt. Lind's locked me in. For my own good, she says. I think she's right."
     ],
     "vo": "brandt_b194c85ab1"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "BRANDT (TAPE)",
      "It talks to me in my mother's voice. My mother's been dead eleven years. When I was posted north she called me on the base radio every Sunday."
     ],
     "vo": "brandt_65881e4303"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "BRANDT (TAPE)",
      "Every Sunday for six years. On the radio. That's how it got her. It's got everyone who ever called anyone on a radio. That's everyone."
     ],
     "vo": "brandt_bfa7c8e5ea"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "BRANDT (TAPE)",
      "Lind wrote the code on the outside so the next shift could let me out. I scratched it into the paint as well, in case she forgot."
     ],
     "vo": "brandt_3931bb4f63"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "BRANDT (TAPE)",
      "If you're listening to this, don't answer it. Whoever it sounds like. Don't answer."
     ],
     "vo": "brandt_d657c073f0"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "steps": [
